                    "details": "- Removes this node's `callAfter()`, `callEvery()`, and `callEveryCatchUp()` timers. Descendant timers and async timers are unaffected; no value is returned.\n- May be called inside a frame timer callback. The current callback finishes, but other cancelled callbacks and remaining catch-up calls do not run.\n- See `Node::callAfter` for the shared frame timer rules.",
