                    "desc": "How much a client has queued and not yet completed, in bytes (0 for an unknown client)",
                    "details": "The measure of back-pressure: it rises when a peer stops keeping up and falls as the queue drains. Compare it against getSendAsyncBufferSize() to see how close that client is to refusing further sendAsync() calls.",
